589				<h2>Welcome to Accessible HTML5</h2>
590				<p>This is a well-structured, accessible HTML5 document demonstrating modern best practices for semantic markup and inclusive design.</p>
591				<p>
592					It uses semantic landmarks, a skip link for keyboard navigation,
593					and CSS that adapts to your light or dark mode preference.
594				</p>
595				<p>
596					Text and link colors meet WCAG AA contrast in both themes, type scales
597					with your browser's font size, and motion respects your system settings.
598				</p>
